              "fill": "$on-ink-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Stepped fret after a garment panel on Border Fragment, Paracas, 450–175 BCE — The Metropolitan Museum of Art, 1994.35.120, public domain (CC0). Structure after Gego, Torres-García and the Taller de Gráfica Popular; no work by those artists is reproduced.",
